== Greeting == Keep your blade close, $C. The Vale is not what it was.
== Facts == {| class="wikitable article-facts" |- ! Title | Town Marshal |- ! Position | 4, 6 |- ! Quest count | 5 |- ! Vendor | No |}
== Quests == * [[Wolves at the Door]] * [[The Old Wolf]] * [[Bandits of the Vale]] * [[The Ringleader]] * [[Mogger Must Fall]] [[Category:NPCs]]

== Greeting == Careful where you step in the eastern woods, friend.
== Facts == {| class="wikitable article-facts" |- ! Title | Herbalist |- ! Position | 11, -3 |- ! Quest count | 1 |- ! Vendor | No |}
== Quests == * [[Webwood Menace]] [[Category:NPCs]]

== Greeting == The Light keep you. Even the dead find no rest here of late.
== Facts == {| class="wikitable article-facts" |- ! Title | Priest of the Vale |- ! Position | -14, -10 |- ! Quest count | 9 |- ! Vendor | No |}
== Quests == * [[The Restless Dead]] * [[Whispers Below]] * [[The Names of the Dead]] * [[Silence the Call]] * [[The Binding Rite]] * [[The Sexton's Bell]] * [[Into the Hollow]] * [[The Gravecaller's Trail]] * [[Muster at Fenbridge]] [[Category:NPCs]]

== Greeting == Mind the sparks, $C. Good steel is the difference between a scar and a grave.
== Facts == {| class="wikitable article-facts" |- ! Title | Armorer & Weaponsmith |- ! Position | 7, 16.5 |- ! Quest count | 0 |- ! Vendor | Yes |}
== Vendor stock == * [[Eastbrook Arming Sword]] * [[Bronzework Mace]] * [[Vale Carving Knife]] * [[Hickory Shortstaff]] * [[Eastbrook Chainmail Vest]] * [[Valespun Robe]] * [[Tanned Leather Jerkin]] * [[Hobnailed Boots]] * [[Eastbrook Wool Trousers]] [[Category:NPCs]]

== Greeting == Whole dig's crawling with those candle-headed vermin!
== Facts == {| class="wikitable article-facts" |- ! Title | Mine Foreman |- ! Position | -4, -14 |- ! Quest count | 1 |- ! Vendor | No |}
== Quests == * [[Rats in the Mine]] [[Category:NPCs]]

== Greeting == Hold at the gate, $C. Past those reeds, the fen does the killing for us.
== Facts == {| class="wikitable article-facts" |- ! Title | Warden of Fenbridge |- ! Position | 3, 304 |- ! Quest count | 6 |- ! Vendor | No |}
== Quests == * [[Muster at Fenbridge]] * [[Teeth of the Fen]] * [[The Deepfen Stirs]] * [[Back to the Shallows]] * [[Mounds of the Mirefen]] * [[The Deacon of the Mire]] [[Category:NPCs]]

== Greeting == The Light keep you above the water, $N. The dead in this fen do not sleep — they wade.
== Facts == {| class="wikitable article-facts" |- ! Title | Priest of the Vale |- ! Position | -8, 296 |- ! Quest count | 9 |- ! Vendor | No |}
